# Never ship local state, secrets, or build artifacts into an image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files (secrets live in the orchestrator, not the image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Git / editor / local tooling metadata
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.freebuff

# Local infrastructure data, logs and docs
infrastructure/*.log
**/*.log
docs
*.md
!README.md
